Pharmaceutical Prime Vendor Agreement between Omnicare, Inc. and McKesson Corporation (2015)
Contract Categories: Business Operations › Supply Agreements
Summary
This agreement, effective January 1, 2015, is between Omnicare, Inc., a pharmacy chain, and McKesson Corporation, a pharmaceutical wholesaler. Under the agreement, McKesson will serve as Omnicare’s primary supplier of branded and generic pharmaceutical products for Omnicare’s owned and managed facilities. The contract outlines pricing, supply obligations, and terms for purchasing, delivery, and payment. It also includes provisions for confidentiality, product definitions, and procedures for adding or removing Omnicare facilities. Certain confidential terms have been omitted from the public version of the agreement.

